Initial release — visits, reminders and the arrears round

The field officer's round: who was visited, who was reminded, and who has
been neither.

The arrears query reads the customers and loans tables directly, and that is a
deliberate exception rather than an oversight. Pulling every arrears customer
into PHP to join against visits and reminders would lose the aggregation, the
paging and the ordering, to gain a purity nobody can point at.

What WAS wrong was the silent half of that coupling: the status this module
filtered on was hardcoded. It now asks the loans module what arrears means, and
declares the dependency, so a change there fails the boot instead of quietly
returning an empty round.
